line = ("- **§934.47 addendum 105 — EM-R0a LANDED (`26f22d394`, THE TWELFTH LANDING: nine mutants each convicted under its own title; both sealed verbs red on the one named pre-existing title only; the sealed `tests/lint` step 175 / 2791) AND FLIPPED (`d8bf52f82`); THE SECOND COMPOSITION'S NINE COMPOSED (tip `85c27f95d` — CURE-J's re-recorded golden is on the branch; the one blob difference explained); FIX-P1c TO ITS LANE; ITS SEVEN ITEMS FATED (the NUL recurs through TOOLING — a " + NUL + " escape through a JSON tool parameter becomes the byte); PREPROOF-EM-R0d-v4 READY-ABLE (2026-09-20 " + stamp + " EDT; the chair; vetoable).** " + body)
